{
  "about": [
    "Golden vectors of the bridge protocol: every domain tag, and cases of every value two or more implementations derive from a tag. The Solidity, Rust, Python and JavaScript implementations each check their own code against this file; vectors/record.mjs is an independent implementation of the formulas below.",
    "Hashed outputs start as null. `node vectors/record.mjs` fills each null once and never overwrites a recorded output; `node vectors/record.mjs --check` recomputes every output and fails on any difference or remaining null. A test that meets a null fails until the values are recorded and reviewed. Burn scripts involve no hash and are written by hand.",
    "Changing any tag makes a new instance. Guest tags (lc, update, eth_config) change the guest ELF, its vkey and the update leaf; claim tags (state, claimed, token_blinding_a, token_blinding_b) change the claim leaf and the state address; escrow tags (deposit, burn) change the escrow bytecode. The manifest tag is the manifest schema the tools accept.",
    "Hex is 0x-prefixed lowercase; integers are JSON numbers below 2^53."
  ],
  "tags": {
    "state": "liquid-bridge-poc/state",
    "claimed": "liquid-bridge-poc/claimed",
    "lc": "liquid-bridge-poc/lc",
    "update": "liquid-bridge-poc/update",
    "eth_config": "liquid-bridge-poc/eth-config",
    "deposit": "liquid-bridge-poc/deposit",
    "burn": "liquid-bridge-poc/burn",
    "token_blinding_a": "liquid-bridge-poc/token-blinding/A",
    "token_blinding_b": "liquid-bridge-poc/token-blinding/B",
    "manifest": "liquid-bridge-poc/manifest"
  },
  "formulas": {
    "tag_sha256": "SHA256(tag), for the tags used hashed: state, claimed, lc, update, eth_config",
    "lc": "SHA256(SHA256(tags.lc) || be64(slot) || header || committee)",
    "state_hash": "SHA256(SHA256(tags.state) || lc || acc || claimed_root)",
    "claimed_root": "A depth-32 SHA-256 sparse Merkle tree indexed by deposit number. An unset leaf is 32 zero bytes; a set leaf is SHA256(tags.claimed); each parent is SHA256(left || right).",
    "token_blinding": "a = SHA256(tags.token_blinding_a || entropy), b = SHA256(tags.token_blinding_b || entropy), the tags not hashed",
    "deposit_domain": "SHA256(tags.deposit || be256(chain_id) || escrow), the tag not hashed: abi.encodePacked(string, uint256, address)",
    "burn_script": "6a 46 || tags.burn (22 bytes) || be64(chain_id) || escrow || recipient: 72 bytes"
  },
